        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Phil Lloyd, Julia Gillard, Trent O'Donnell, Patrick Brammall, Tim Mathieson, Myles Barlow\n- Productions: Review with Myles Barlow, At Home with Julia, A Moody Christmas, Offspring, Glitch\n- Organizations: Australian Labor Party, ABC, Channel Ten\n- Roles: Prime Minister of Australia, actor, writer, creator, director, partner\n\nFacts:\n- Julia Gillard was born on 29 September 1961.\n- Julia Gillard was the 27th Prime Minister of Australia from 2010 to 2013 as Leader of the Australian Labor Party.\n- Phil Lloyd is best known for playing Myles Barlow in the Australian TV series Review with Myles Barlow.\n- Phil Lloyd is best known for playing Tim Mathieson, the partner of Prime Minister Julia Gillard, in the comedy series At Home with Julia.\n- A Moody Christmas was written and created by Trent O'Donnell and Phil Lloyd at Jungleboys.\n- A Moody Christmas was directed by Trent O'Donnell.\n- Patrick Brammall is best known for playing Sean Moody in the ABC comedy A Moody Christmas.\n- Patrick Brammall is best known for playing Leo Taylor in season 5 of the Channel Ten series Offspring.\n- Patrick Brammall is best known for playing Sergeant James Hayes in the ABC series Glitch.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
